tar for BUC testing and an almost-guaranteed shop for price testing. You mi=
ght even get lucky and find a magic lamp or bag of holding.
* When you're ready to #dip for Excalibur, here are some tips. Don't do it =
in Minetown, too risky that you'll tick off the guards. Some people wait un=
